# What must NOT be published to the live site.
#
# Everything here still lives in the repo and in git history; it is simply not
# uploaded to Vercel, so it cannot be fetched, crawled or indexed.

# secondary-domain/ was deleted on 2026-10-20 and the rule for it is gone with
# it. It held 98 near-duplicate pages for sanantonioglasssolutions.com and
# masterglasssolutionsusa.com that nothing routed to -- no host rewrite, no
# host matching -- while still needing a hand-sync every time a site-wide fact
# changed. It fell out of sync twice in one day, on the address and on the
# review count. Both domains already serve the main site, which is what
# consolidates them. It is recoverable from git history if those domains ever
# need to be served separately, but that would want host rewrites in
# vercel.json rather than a second copy of every page.

# Internal audits, checklists and the customer-facing update report. Useful to
# keep, never meant to be served from the marketing site.
docs/

# Build and repair scripts, including the add-gtm*.ps1 injectors that put the
# GTM snippet on every page twice and broke an HTML comment on the homepage.
tools/

# Agent and editor config.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Local only.
node_modules/

